# Floating Modal — a "+" floating button that morphs (size, position, radius, icon rotation) into a centred "New" modal; the modal can be dragged and closes when pulled down far enough (scale < 0.95).
# What this test covers: open via the FAB, close via the rotated "x", close by tapping the backdrop, drag up and
# release (springs back, stays open), a small downward drag under the threshold (stays open), a long downward drag
# (closes), a diagonal drag, pressing Done (no-op), toggling the FAB while the morph is mid-flight, and dragging
# the closed FAB (ignored).
context platform=ios
open "demos://animations/floating-modal"
wait "label=\"Close\"" 40000
wait 800
# Open, then close with the rotated "+" in the modal's corner.
press 338 810
wait 900
wait "text" "New" 3000
press 52 288
wait 900
# Open and close by tapping the backdrop.
press 338 810
wait 900
press 200 760
wait 900
# Open; drag up and release: springs back and stays open.
press 338 810
wait 900
gesture pan 200 420 0 -150 500
wait 900
# Small downward drag (under the close threshold): stays open.
gesture pan 200 420 0 25 400
wait 900
# Diagonal drag up-right: stays open.
gesture pan 200 420 80 -60 400
wait 900
# Done has no handler; pressing it must not break anything.
press 200 578
wait 600
# Long downward drag: closes the modal.
gesture pan 200 420 0 150 500
wait 1000
# Dragging the closed FAB is ignored.
gesture pan 338 810 -100 -100 400
wait 800
# Toggle mid-morph: open then close before the timing settles, then reopen.
press 338 810
wait 150
press 338 810
wait 1000
press 338 810
wait 150
press 200 760
wait 1200
# Rapid toggles on the FAB.
press 338 810 --count 5 --interval-ms 100
wait 1200
# The burst ends opened (odd count), close with the backdrop.
press 200 760
wait 1000
wait "label=\"Close\"" 3000
press "label=\"Close\""
wait 1500
